<h2 id="sec-research-summary" class="section-title">
  <span data-language="en" lang="en">🧭 Research Summary</span>
  <span data-language="zh" lang="zh-CN">🧭 研究总结</span>
</h2>
<div class="clearfix research-summary">
  <div data-language="en" lang="en">
    <p>My research focuses on <strong>post-training and alignment for generative models</strong>, with two main goals: improving text-motion alignment and developing post-training methods for large-scale text-to-image models in industry.</p>
    <p>At <strong>PALM@SEU</strong>, advised by Prof. <a href="https://cs.seu.edu.cn/hongsongwang/main.htm">Hongsong Wang</a>, I study text–motion alignment in motion generation: <a href="{{ '/projects/SoPo/index.html' | relative_url }}">SoPo</a> (NeurIPS 2025) addresses scarce preference pairs and sampling bias; <a href="https://wengwanjiang.github.io/ReAlign-page/">ReAlign</a> (AAAI 2026) aligns pretrained generators without fine-tuning; and <a href="{{ '/projects/EasyTune/index.html' | relative_url }}">EasyTune</a> (ICLR 2026) improves alignment with substantially less memory. Building on this, <a href="{{ '/projects/MotionRFT/index.html' | relative_url }}">MotionRFT</a> (IEEE TPAMI 2026) extends post-training across motion representations, improving HY Motion’s FID by 23.3%.</p>
    <p>At <strong>Tencent YouTu</strong>, I focused on image-generation post-training, addressing underexplored barriers to deployment: visual hallucinations with <a href="{{ '/projects/ConsistentRFT/index.html' | relative_url }}">DPGO</a> (under review), and diversity collapse with <a href="{{ '/projects/PEC/index.html' | relative_url }}">PEC</a> (NeurIPS 2026, <strong>Spotlight</strong>).</p>
    <p>At <strong>Tencent HY</strong>, I study the reliability of reward supervision and learning progression, collaborating with Prof. <a href="https://faculty.ucmerced.edu/mhyang/">Ming-Hsuan Yang</a> as a remote visiting student at <strong>UC Merced</strong>. Our <a href="{{ '/projects/SpatialReward/index.html' | relative_url }}">SpatialCritic</a> (under review) addresses these challenges in spatial generation, achieving 95.08% spatial-preference verification accuracy on our SpaRW-Eval benchmark.</p>
    <p>My earlier anomaly-detection research began at <strong>SZU</strong> with Prof. <a href="https://csse.szu.edu.cn/pages/user/index?id=953">Can Gao</a> (<a href="{{ '/Publications/' | relative_url }}#tanGB">MGBOD</a>, IEEE TKDE 2025) and later extended to video (<a href="{{ '/projects/FG-Diff/index.html' | relative_url }}">FG-Diff</a>, IEEE TIP 2026). <strong>Looking ahead, I aim to develop post-training methods for video generation and world models, with an emphasis on physical consistency.</strong></p>
  </div>
  <div data-language="zh" lang="zh-CN">
    <p>我的研究围绕<strong>生成模型的后训练与对齐</strong>展开，主要关注提升文本与动作对齐，以及在工业界研发大规模文生图模型的后训练方法。</p>
    <p>在 <strong>PALM@SEU</strong>，我在 <a href="https://cs.seu.edu.cn/hongsongwang/main.htm">Hongsong Wang（王洪松）</a>教授指导下，研究动作生成中的文本与动作对齐：<a href="{{ '/projects/SoPo/index.html' | relative_url }}">SoPo</a>（NeurIPS 2025）应对偏好对稀缺与采样偏差；<a href="https://wengwanjiang.github.io/ReAlign-page/">ReAlign</a>（AAAI 2026）无需微调即可对齐预训练生成模型；<a href="{{ '/projects/EasyTune/index.html' | relative_url }}">EasyTune</a>（ICLR 2026）在提升对齐效果的同时大幅降低显存开销。在此基础上，<a href="{{ '/projects/MotionRFT/index.html' | relative_url }}">MotionRFT</a>（IEEE TPAMI 2026）将后训练拓展至不同动作表示，使 HY Motion 的 FID 改善 23.3%。</p>
    <p>在 <strong>Tencent YouTu</strong>，我聚焦图像生成后训练，关注较少受到关注的落地障碍：<a href="{{ '/projects/ConsistentRFT/index.html' | relative_url }}">DPGO</a>（在投）减少视觉幻觉，<a href="{{ '/projects/PEC/index.html' | relative_url }}">PEC</a>（NeurIPS 2026，<strong>Spotlight</strong>）缓解多样性崩溃。</p>
    <p>在 <strong>Tencent HY</strong>，我进一步研究奖励监督的可靠性与学习进程，并以远程访问学生身份与 <strong>UC Merced</strong> 的 <a href="https://faculty.ucmerced.edu/mhyang/">Ming-Hsuan Yang</a> 教授合作。我们提出的 <a href="{{ '/projects/SpatialReward/index.html' | relative_url }}">SpatialCritic</a>（在投）针对空间生成中的这些问题，在我们构建的空间偏好评测基准 SpaRW-Eval 上实现 95.08% 的验证准确率。</p>
    <p>我的早期异常检测研究始于 <strong>SZU</strong>，由 <a href="https://csse.szu.edu.cn/pages/user/index?id=953">Can Gao</a> 教授指导（<a href="{{ '/Publications/' | relative_url }}#tanGB">MGBOD</a>，IEEE TKDE 2025），后来延伸至视频场景（<a href="{{ '/projects/FG-Diff/index.html' | relative_url }}">FG-Diff</a>，IEEE TIP 2026）。<strong>下一步，我希望面向视频生成与世界模型发展后训练方法，重点关注物理一致性。</strong></p>
  </div>
</div>
